---
import Layout from "../../Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Practice">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-xl space-y-6 px-4 pb-12">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="font-semibold text-2xl">Privacy Policy for Practice</h1>
      <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Last updated: November 9, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <p>
      Practice ("we", "our", or "us") makes the Practice: Habit Tracker app for
      iOS, Android, and the web at practice.praveenjuge.com.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Your Account</h2>
      <p>
        You sign in with Apple or Google. Sign-in is handled by WorkOS, our
        authentication provider. From your Apple or Google account we receive
        your email address and, if you share them, your name and profile
        picture. We never see your Apple or Google password.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">What We Store</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Your account details from sign-in, listed above.</li>
        <li>
          The habits you create: their names, categories, and the days you
          check them off.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We use this only to run the app: to sign you in, sync your habits across
        your devices, and show your streaks. We don't sell or share it, and we
        don't use it for advertising.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Where It's Stored</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the app's servers and database,
          where your habits are stored. Cloudflare also keeps short-lived
          request logs (such as IP address and time) for running and securing
          the service.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>WorkOS</strong> stores your account and sign-in sessions.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        On the web, we set one cookie that keeps you signed in. We don't use
        cookies for tracking or advertising.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Analytics and Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Practice doesn't use any analytics, advertising, or tracking services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Deleting Your Data</h2>
      <p>
        You can delete your account at any time from the account menu in the
        app. This permanently deletes your habits and check-ins and removes your
        account from WorkOS. You can also email us and we'll delete it for you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be
        posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us
        at <a
          href="mailto:hello@praveenjuge.com"
          class="underline decoration-2 underline-offset-1"
        >
          hello@praveenjuge.com
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
